    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cubi: Mystery of the unsolved\u00a0</strong>is a challenging puzzle game with 100 levels spread across 10 unique worlds. Enter a vibrant universe filled with puzzles and obstacles as you progress through increasingly difficult levels to unlock new areas. Designed with a balanced difficulty curve, <strong>Cubi: Mystery of the unsolved</strong> offers an exciting experience for both casual players and seasoned gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unique Worlds</strong>: Discover diverse themes and environments, each with its own style and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Levels</strong>: Explore and complete levels to unlock new areas and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System</strong>: Start a new game or pick up right where you left off with an automatic save system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Content</strong>: Progress through levels and worlds, and master each stage to unlock everything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a journey full of excitement, strategy, and discovery! Step into the world of <strong>Cubi: Mystery of the unsolved</strong> and take on a wide variety of unique levels and obstacles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cubi: Mystery of the unsolved\u00a0</strong>is a challenging puzzle game with 100 levels spread across 10 unique worlds. Enter a vibrant universe filled with puzzles and obstacles as you progress through increasingly difficult levels to unlock new areas. Designed with a balanced difficulty curve, <strong>Cubi: Mystery of the unsolved</strong> offers an exciting experience for both casual players and seasoned gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unique Worlds</strong>: Discover diverse themes and environments, each with its own style and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Levels</strong>: Explore and complete levels to unlock new areas and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System</strong>: Start a new game or pick up right where you left off with an automatic save system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Content</strong>: Progress through levels and worlds, and master each stage to unlock everything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a journey full of excitement, strategy, and discovery! Step into the world of <strong>Cubi: Mystery of the unsolved</strong> and take on a wide variety of unique levels and obstacles.</p>",
    "short_description": "An adventurous puzzle-platformer with challenging gameplay. Navigate through 10 unique worlds with 100 levels, unlocking increasingly complex obstacles. Features a smooth difficulty curve, perfect for both casual players and seasoned puzzle enthusiasts.",
